  "summary": "Hello, my name is Anthony Zunk. I've been working in the e-commerce, marketing, web development, social media management, blogging/(SEO), and content writing fields for 7 years. I started out as an e-commerce store owner. I built my own websites when I was 19 years old and launched them when I was 21 after attending marketing and social media management courses with myecomclub. I successfully ran 3 store fronts for 3 years while attending web design and development courses. This is where I grew to love web design/business design. I decided to sell my storefronts and follow my passion for web development. I started freelancing for small local businesses helping people succeed the same way I was able to. Using my skills in web design, social media management, content writing, and SEO services. Helping people out around my community reach their dreams and goals is a feeling I truly enjoy. To further my career and experience I decided to partner with Eastmoor digital and Halstead to help me reach high-end clients and gave me an opportunity to show the true level of experience and dedication that I have in this field. I was able to work with multiple clients with ad spend budgets of 100k and websites over 300 pages. While also working on a countless number of blogs and gaining plenty of experience with content writing and SEO services. Designing people's dreams is my goal and what I love to do. My experience in design, social media marketing/management, e-commerce, content writing, and SEO is how I help take you to the next level and turn your dreams into reality.",
